center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325920/extras/4c0ae6660ba8ab200dde724887984cfd.poster.avif?t=1773936700\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325920/extras/4c0ae6660ba8ab200dde724887984cfd.webm?t=1773936700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2325920/extras/4c0ae6660ba8ab200dde724887984cfd.mp4?t=1773936700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
